    51	additions and 20.57 seconds total; repeated runs on this host ranged from 7.51
    52	to 37.38 seconds.  This is expected on Track B and is reported separately from
    53	attacks.  An efficient algorithm does exist and is not hidden: it is the
    54	`O(m)` cycle-lemma rising product above.  Its submitted symbolic form takes 33
    55	small operations at shipping size and avoids evaluating the large integer.
    56	Once that identity is recognized the problem is easy; the benchmark tests
