     1	# Exact counts of inequivalent minimal cycle factorizations
     2	
     3	| Profile | Value |
     4	|---|---|
     5	| Paper | Berkolaiko, Harrison, Novaes, [*On inequivalent factorizations of a cycle*](https://arxiv.org/abs/0809.3476) |
